WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:10.629
So radium was the element that was discovered
by Madam Curie and its chemistry is very similar

00:00:10.629 --> 00:00:20.359
to that of barium, except that it is radioactive
and it was used quite widely for treatment

00:00:20.359 --> 00:00:27.759
of cancer in the days when radiation was used,
radioactivity was used, for treating Cancer.

00:00:27.759 --> 00:00:38.199
The idea is that cancer cells, well all cells
are liable to be killed by radiation, by radioactivity

00:00:38.199 --> 00:00:44.170
when they are dividing so cancer cells are
cells in the body which are dividing much

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:51.650
faster, out-of-control compared to other cells,
so if you radiate a patient, the cancer cells,

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:57.699
because they are dividing faster, die quicker,
so overall although a lot of cells die, the

00:00:57.699 --> 00:01:06.400
Cancer cells die further. The people, who
discovered radium, were really excited about

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:14.170
it and they were mad with hindsight in the
way they treated it. They carried sort of

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:19.500
little glass tubes of radium in their pockets
and were then surprised when they found burns

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:26.020
on their flesh the next day and it’s thought
that the reason why many of these researchers

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:32.120
like Madam Curie’s husband and Madam Curie
died rather young was the effect of the radioactivity

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:34.110
of the elements that they handled.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:41.430
Well in general as you go down the periodic
table, heavier elements tend to be more dangerous.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:51.600
But even the very reactive ones like fluorine
are usually not very dangerous because they

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:56.860
react with something long before they get
into the body. The radioactive elements tend

00:01:56.860 --> 00:02:03.920
to be dangerous because they can get into
the body and then when they decay, they kill

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:10.979
cells or even worse than killing the cells
is that they change the DNA so that the cells

00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:14.620
mutate into some more aggressive form of cancer.

